# Hiding User Account Via SpecialAccounts Registry Key - CommandLine | T1564.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_registry_special_accounts_hide_user.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 Image="*\\reg.exe" CommandLine="*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Winlogon\\SpecialAccounts\\UserList*" CommandLine="*add*" CommandLine="*/v*" CommandLine="*/d 0*"
